---
title: Tagged
description: Articles by tag.
layout: blog-base.liquid
data:
  nav: tags
pagination:
  include: Tags
  per_page: 100
---
{% comment %}
  Single-tag archive — design 4b. Generated once per tag by Cobalt's
  tag pagination (include: Tags). Cobalt fills `paginator` per tag:
    paginator.index_title → the tag name
    paginator.pages       → the posts carrying that tag

  ⚠ VERIFY against your Cobalt version — pagination variable names and the
  generated permalink for tag pages have shifted between releases. If your
  build exposes the tag under a different field, adjust `tag` below. The
  README documents the permalink wiring (/tags/<tag>/).
{% endcomment %}
{% assign tag = paginator.index_title %}

<a href="/tags/" class="article-back" style="margin-block-start: var(--space-2xl);">&larr; All tags</a>

<div class="tag-hero" style="margin-block-start: var(--space-m);">
  <h1 class="tag-hero__name">#{{ tag }}</h1>
  <span class="tag-hero__count">{{ paginator.pages.size }} articles</span>
</div>

<hr class="rule-strong" style="margin-block-start: var(--space-l);">

<ul class="post-list">
  {% for post in paginator.pages %}
  <li class="post-entry">
    <div class="article-meta">
      <span>{{ post.published_date | date: "%b %d, %Y" }}</span><span class="sep">&middot;</span>
      <span>{{ post.data.minutes }} min</span>
    </div>
    <a href="{{ post.permalink }}" class="post-entry__title">{{ post.title }}</a>
    {% if post.description %}<p class="post-entry__dek">{{ post.description }}</p>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
